'''Better get movin'''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to defeat [[Elidinis' Warden]] in phase three of the Wardens fight with 'Aerial Assault', 'Stay vigilant' and 'Insanity' invocations activated, and without dying, at raid level 150 or above.

Completing the raid with the specified invocations, without fighting the correct warden in phase three, still yields in success.

